{
  "_comment": [
    "BI_SERVER_LIVE_SCHEMA_GUARD_v6",
    "Column lists read from bi-pg01 (production) on 2026-08-03.",
    "scripts/check-schema-drift.mjs compares every INSERT INTO in src/ against",
    "this. It exists because 15 tables in src/db/migrations are created by more",
    "than one migration with CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS and DISAGREE on columns,",
    "so the live shape depends on which migration ran first - and code written",
    "against the losing twin fails at runtime, usually inside a catch.",
    "",
    "To refresh after a schema change, in Azure Cloud Shell:",
    "  psql \"$BI_DATABASE_URL\" -At -c \"SELECT table_name || ': ' ||",
    "    string_agg(column_name, ' ' ORDER BY ordinal_position)",
    "    FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema='public'",
    "    AND table_name LIKE 'bi_%' GROUP BY table_name ORDER BY table_name;\"",
    "Only tables listed here are checked; add a table to widen coverage."
  ],
